error[E0277]: the trait bound `String: From<Untrusted<String>>` is not satisfied
 --> tests/ui/no_into.rs:6:32
  |
6 |     let _plain: String = label.into();
  |                                ^^^^ the trait `From<Untrusted<String>>` is not implemented for `String`
  |
  = help: `String` implements trait `From<T>`:
            From<&String>
            From<&mut str>
            From<&str>
            From<Box<str>>
            From<Cow<'_, str>>
            From<char>
  = note: required for `Untrusted<String>` to implement `Into<String>`
